# SOC Home Lab - Suricata alert tuning (Suricata 8 threshold.config syntax)
# Each entry records why the noise is accepted. Review quarterly.

# The SOC management VLAN runs curl-based health checks and API scripts.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 1000005, track by_src, ip 10.0.1.0/24

# Wazuh agents and the SOAR host poll their APIs over HTTPS on 55000/9200;
# only those hosts are exempt from the non-standard-port rule.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 1000013, track by_src, ip 10.0.1.10
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 1000013, track by_src, ip 10.0.1.13

# The internal resolver legitimately generates bursts of queries; keep the
# alert for every other host.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 1000003, track by_src, ip 10.0.0.1
